# Cypress Retreat — Montgomery County, TX modern-farmhouse barndominium
# Broken massing (not a plain rectangle): the conditioned house is a deep 60 ft
# bar on the west; the gym is a shallower 48 ft bar on the east, so the footprint
# steps back at the north-east (an L). A full-width covered porch fronts the house.
# Board-and-batten + standing-seam metal, steep 6:12 gables — modern farmhouse.
plan "Cypress Retreat"
envelope 90 x 48
wing 54 x 12 at 0,48            # house runs 12 ft deeper than the gym -> L footprint
ceiling 11
orientation 0
program 3 bed 3 bath
finish siding "board-and-batten" roof "standing-seam metal"
roof gable pitch 0.5
note "Interconnected smoke + CO alarms per IRC R314/R315 (attached garage). Garage-to-dwelling wall = fire separation; garage doors = self-closing 20-min rated. Modern-farmhouse exterior: board-and-batten siding, black-framed windows, standing-seam metal roof, covered porch."

# ======================= CONDITIONED RESIDENCE (x 0..54) =======================
# ---- public core (south band, y 0..20) ----
room living:  living   at 0,0    size 28 x 20 vaulted
room kitchen: kitchen  at 28,0   size 16 x 16
room pantry:  pantry   at 28,16  size 8 x 4
room mud:     mudroom  at 36,16  size 8 x 4
room lounge:  living   at 44,0   size 10 x 20        # gym-view lounge (east wall on the turf bay)

# ---- main spine (y 20..24) ----
room hall:    hallway  at 0,20   size 54 x 4

# ---- primary suite (west, y 24..60) ----
room mbed:    bedroom  at 0,24   size 20 x 20
room mcloset: closet   at 0,44   size 10 x 16
room mbath:   bathroom at 10,44  size 10 x 16

# ---- secondary circulation ----
room hall2:   hallway  at 20,24  size 4 x 24         # N-S link, x 20..24, y 24..48
room hall3:   hallway  at 24,44  size 30 x 4         # E-W gallery, x 24..54, y 44..48

# ---- service band (y 24..44, x 24..54) ----
room safe:    other    at 24,24  size 12 x 10        # FEMA-rated safe room (hardened, windowless)
room half:    half_bath at 36,24 size 6 x 10
room store:   closet    at 42,24 size 12 x 10        # bulk / storm-supply storage
room bath2:   bathroom  at 24,34 size 12 x 10
room laundry: laundry   at 36,34 size 18 x 10

# ---- secondary bedrooms (north wing, y 48..60) ----
room bed2:    bedroom  at 20,48  size 12 x 12
room closet2: closet   at 32,48  size 6 x 12
room closet3: closet   at 38,48  size 6 x 12
room bed3:    bedroom  at 44,48  size 10 x 12        # NE corner now on the L step -> east window

# ============================ ATTACHED GYM (x 54..90, y 0..48) =================
room turf:    other  at 54,0   size 18 x 24 ceiling 14   # artificial-turf training bay
room tumble:  other  at 54,24  size 18 x 24 ceiling 14   # rubber-matted tumbling bay
room boat:    garage at 72,0   size 18 x 48 ceiling 14   # boat / trailer garage (outer edge)

# ------------------------------- covered porch --------------------------------
porch front_porch at 0,-8 size 54 x 8 covered

# ------------------------------- connections ----------------------------------
# open conditioned core
open living - kitchen width 10
open kitchen - lounge width 8
open living - hall width 4
door kitchen - pantry width 2.67 offset 0.5
door kitchen - mud width 2.67 offset 0.5

# spine -> suite / secondary
open hall - hall2 width 4
open hall2 - hall3 width 4
door hall2 - mbed width 3 offset 0.5
door mbed - mcloset width 2.5 offset 0.5
door mbed - mbath width 2.67 offset 0.5
door hall2 - safe swing width 3 offset 0.5
door hall - half width 2.5 offset 1.5
door hall - store width 2.5 offset 9
door hall3 - bath2 width 2.67 offset 0.5
door hall3 - laundry width 2.5 offset 1
door hall3 - bed2 width 3 offset 4
door hall3 - bed3 width 3 offset 6
door bed2 - closet2 width 2.5 offset 0.5
door bed3 - closet3 width 2.5 offset 0.5

# conditioned -> gym (safety door, self-closing)
door lounge - turf swing width 3 offset 14

# gym interior circulation
door turf - tumble width 3 offset 1
door turf - boat width 3 offset 1
door tumble - boat width 3 offset 1

# ------------------------------- exterior doors -------------------------------
entry living south width 3 offset 20
entry hall west width 3 offset 0.5
entry turf south width 3 offset 1
entry tumble north width 3 offset 1
entry boat south width 3 offset 3
door boat east exterior width 16 offset 16 no-egress   # boat overhead door

# ------------------------------- windows --------------------------------------
# residence exterior daylight / egress
window living south width 10 offset 3
window living west width 8 offset 6
window kitchen south width 8 offset 4
window lounge south width 6 offset 2
window mbed west width 10 offset 5
window mbath north width 3 offset 3
window bed2 north width 5 offset 4
window bed3 north width 5 offset 3
window bed3 east width 4 offset 3        # new east window on the L step

# gym exterior daylight
window turf south width 8 offset 5
window tumble north width 8 offset 5

# tempered interior vision panels — parent supervision sightlines
window lounge east width 6 offset 6      # lounge -> turf
window turf north width 8 offset 5       # turf -> tumble
window turf east width 6 offset 8        # turf -> boat bay
window tumble east width 6 offset 8      # tumble -> boat bay
